WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.199
Father: Ricky, school is starting again soon.

2
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.758
Are you excited?

3
00:00:05.759 --> 00:00:09.272
Ricky: I am excited and nervous.

4
00:00:09.273 --> 00:00:11.473
Rachel: Why are you nervous,

5
00:00:11.474 --> 00:00:13.540
Ricky? School will be fun.

6
00:00:13.541 --> 00:00:15.268
Ricky: How do you know?

7
00:00:15.269 --> 00:00:18.285
You haven't been to school yet!

8
00:00:18.286 --> 00:00:22.545
Rachel: I went to preschool! It's always fun.

9
00:00:22.546 --> 00:00:25.183
Ricky: Preschool is all playtime.

10
00:00:25.184 --> 00:00:28.543
You don't have to study.

11
00:00:28.544 --> 00:00:30.527
Father: That's enough, you two.

12
00:00:30.528 --> 00:00:33.414
Ricky, what do you need for school?

13
00:00:33.415 --> 00:00:37.935
Let's make a list. Ricky:

14
00:00:37.936 --> 00:00:42.193
I need sour candy, lots of sour candy.

15
00:00:42.194 --> 00:00:45.929
And a book bag and roller rocket shoes. Then

16
00:00:45.930 --> 00:00:49.219
I can move around quickly. Father:

17
00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:52.434
Ricky, rocket shoes aren't real. And

18
00:00:52.435 --> 00:00:54.632
they aren't needed for school. I

19
00:00:54.633 --> 00:00:58.680
think you need pencils and notebooks. Ricky: How

20
00:00:58.681 --> 00:01:02.393
will I get to school without rocket shoes? Father:

21
00:01:02.394 --> 00:01:05.466
By walking, Ricky! Rachel:

22
00:01:05.467 --> 00:01:08.056
I need scissors and glue, Dad. Ricky:

23
00:01:08.057 --> 00:01:11.820
And a baby carriage to ride to school.

24
00:01:11.821 --> 00:01:15.102
Father: That's enough, you guys. Great lists!

25
00:01:15.103 --> 00:01:19.875
We'll go shopping tomorrow.

26
00:01:19.876 --> 00:01:25.273
Ricky: Rachel, what are you doing?

27
00:01:25.274 --> 00:01:27.276
Rachel: I'm making a classroom.

28
00:01:27.277 --> 00:01:29.734
Let's play school, Ricky.

29
00:01:29.735 --> 00:01:33.498
Ricky: I don't want to play school!

30
00:01:33.499 --> 00:01:37.718
Rachel: Hello! I'm Mrs.

31
00:01:37.719 --> 00:01:40.305
Raccoon. Ricky, please take your seat.

32
00:01:40.306 --> 00:01:43.164
Rachel: Welcome to your first day of

33
00:01:43.165 --> 00:01:45.352
school! Do you have any questions?

34
00:01:45.353 --> 00:01:48.961
Ricky: No. No one has any questions.

35
00:01:48.962 --> 00:01:52.071
Rachel: Good. Take out your books,

36
00:01:52.072 --> 00:01:57.287
please. Read pages 4 to 7. Write a ten-page story.

37
00:01:57.288 --> 00:02:02.926
Tell me why your sister is great.

